#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:5 bd77d34e01ae489697dd90bc857c4a12
msgid "SLCAN Access on F4 based Autopilots"
msgstr "F4 飞控的 SLCAN 访问"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:7 44d563d01d804f57bc1f2502e07daed5
msgid ""
"Enabling SLCAN allows the autopilot to connect to CANBUS through USB on PC. "
"It allows viewing, configuration and software updates of devices connected "
"to the CANBUS. There are two different applications for using SLCAN to "
"modify DroneCAN device parameter: DroneCAN GUI or Mission Planner. But "
"first, the SLCAN interface must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"启用 SLCAN 允许飞控通过 PC 上的 USB 连接到 CANBUS。它允许查看、配置和更新连接到 CANBUS "
"的设备的软件。有两种不同的应用程序可通过 SLCAN 修改 DroneCAN 设备参数：DroneCAN GUI 或 Mission "
"Planner。但首先，必须启用 SLCAN 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:11 e710bea5bd12443181a8cb1ce7f777eb
msgid ""
"SLCAN access via COM port is disabled when armed to lower cpu load. Use "
"SLCAN via MAVLink instead. MAVLink access is generally preferred in any "
"case."
msgstr ""
"解锁时通过 COM 端口的 SLCAN 访问被禁用，以降低 CPU 负载。请改用通过 MAVLink 的 SLCAN。任何情况下通常首选 MAVLink"
" 访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:14 4f385f755939430684d1cc2d9490d86c
msgid "Enabling SLCAN"
msgstr "启用 SLCAN"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:16 1062f6d3442a426ca31ea168be9dc4e0
msgid "Connect the autopilot to Mission Planner."
msgstr "将飞控连接到 Mission Planner。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:18 2ea06b76fd984ef1b77d15f2dd3b5229
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAN_SLCAN_CPORT<CAN_SLCAN_CPORT>` = 1, if not already set, or =2 "
"if its desired to examine the second CAN bus, if the autopilot provides it, "
"and reboot."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`CAN_SLCAN_CPORT<CAN_SLCAN_CPORT>` 设为1（如果尚未设置），或设为2（如果希望检查第二个 CAN "
"总线，前提是飞控提供该总线），然后重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:22 61b57ac6bc414ffcadf3f111487b2cdf
msgid ""
"Connect normally to Mission Planner and navigate to Initial Setup->Optional "
"Hardware->UAVCAN(DroneCAN). Click on SLCan Mode CAN1, and any attached "
"DroneCAN nodes using Driver 1 will appear and firmware updates or parameter "
"changes of the node are now available. To return to normal Mission Planner "
"operation, leave this tab for 2 seconds and reconnect to Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"正常连接到 Mission Planner 并导航至 Initial Setup->Optional "
"Hardware->UAVCAN(DroneCAN)。点击「SLCan Mode CAN1」，使用驱动器1的已连接 DroneCAN "
"节点将会出现，现在可以对节点进行固件更新或参数更改。要返回正常的 Mission Planner 操作，离开此标签页2秒钟并重新连接到 Mission "
"Planner。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:28 9a6144ca70bb4a27b2e28e4ebeb2c5a5
msgid "Making Changes to DroneCAN Devices"
msgstr "修改 DroneCAN 设备"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:30 5a22095e3b4e43d5828f9ea52e0c52d1
msgid ""
"Once SLCAN has been enabled, you can use :ref:`Mission Planner "
"<planner:dronecan-uavcan-slcan>`  to make changes immediately to device "
"parameters or firmware update."
msgstr ""
"启用 SLCAN 后，您可以使用 :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:dronecan-uavcan-slcan>` "
"立即对设备参数进行更改或固件更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:32 1957da8644fa4460b1e74db0dcb450df
msgid ""
":ref:`DroneCAN GUI tool <common-uavcan-gui>` can also be used, but requires "
"a slightly different setup:"
msgstr ":ref:`DroneCAN GUI 工具 <common-uavcan-gui>` 也可以使用，但需要稍有不同的设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:35 bdb243bdb61840a4a427612c8363af71
msgid "Enabling Use of DroneCAN GUI"
msgstr "启用 DroneCAN GUI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:37 74210933198040438e4a2e316af1c42c
msgid ""
"Connect the flight autopilot to Mission Planner. Set the parameter "
":ref:`CAN_SLCAN_CPORT<CAN_SLCAN_CPORT>` = 1 , if not already set, and "
"reboot."
msgstr ""
"将飞控连接到 Mission Planner。如果尚未设置，将参数 :ref:`CAN_SLCAN_CPORT<CAN_SLCAN_CPORT>` "
"设为1，然后重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:39 0ae20395b4b44d2db4d0ff3e308f4118
msgid ""
"Reconnect Mission Planner and set :ref:`CAN_SLCAN_SERNUM<CAN_SLCAN_SERNUM>` "
"= 0. This will direct the output to the autopilot's SERIAL0 port which is "
"normally the autopilot USB connection. Be sure that the "
":ref:`CAN_SLCAN_TIMOUT<CAN_SLCAN_TIMOUT>` parameter is 0 to prevent "
"timeouts."
msgstr ""
"重新连接 Mission Planner 并将 :ref:`CAN_SLCAN_SERNUM<CAN_SLCAN_SERNUM>` "
"设为0。这将把输出定向到飞控的 SERIAL0 端口，通常是飞控的 USB 连接。确保 "
":ref:`CAN_SLCAN_TIMOUT<CAN_SLCAN_TIMOUT>` 参数为0以防止超时。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:43 e4ca7d4b08dd4d18859d8f232516c59f
msgid ""
"Do not reboot, and click SLCAN Mode CAN1 in the Initial Setup->Optional "
"Hardware->UAVCAN(DroneCAN). Now open the :ref:`DroneCAN GUI tool<common-"
"uavcan-gui>`."
msgstr ""
"不要重启，点击 Initial Setup->Optional Hardware->UAVCAN(DroneCAN) 中的「SLCAN Mode "
"CAN1」。现在打开 :ref:`DroneCAN GUI 工具<common-uavcan-gui>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f4.rst:45 6ed363b2b36f4358b691e3b6994a29f0
msgid ""
"In this mode, you can also use Mission Planner's DroneCAN page to make "
"changes, but it will not connect normally as a MAVLink Ground Station. To "
"re-connect Mission Planner, you will need to reboot the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"在此模式下，您也可以使用 Mission Planner 的 DroneCAN 页面进行更改，但它不会作为 MAVLink 地面站正常连接。要重新连接 "
"Mission Planner，您需要重启飞控。"
